 — Human Rights Law → Policy Researcher, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human Rights Law","Public Policy","Research Methodology","Data Analysis","Governance","Digital Rights","AI Policy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination moves the graduate beyond conventional legal research and creates opportunities across think tanks, human-rights organizations, public-policy institutions, government programs, international organizations, research institutes, advocacy organizations and technology-policy teams."}]}]}